{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方最大、最亮的紫色标题“舍不得被当作自己人的日子”，随后落到紧接着的同样醒目的副标题“一阵心慌”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不确定。只能模糊感觉到与过去被接纳、被当作自己人有关，无法第一眼判断此刻具体发生了什么。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心慌。\",\n  \"missed\": \"那扇门再次出现，却不再像从前一样具有召唤力；重新面对过去那个不知所措的自己；虽然已经知道过去经历了什么，但问题仍没有简单答案，真正向前的步伐还没有聚起来。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"放大的主标题本身说不清人物此刻的具体处境。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在主标题、副标题和正文之间，需要拼接才能理解心慌与过去经历之间的关系。\",\n    \"正文连续排列多行较长文字，具体处境和情绪成因需要细读才能获得。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9f6e27da-4813-4419-a300-22377ea48b8c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T023058549906Z", "elapsed_seconds": 19.39, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:31:17.938883+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cd959ae757d35affca1600da05161a49ec2610cc59f40e9440b703609f037b80", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f